ing; however, it is not intended to be human-readable. When expected as an input type, any string (such as `\\\"4\\\"`) or integer (such as `4`) input value will be accepted as an ID.\",\"fields\":{},\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"ID\"},\"IssueClosedStateReason\":{\"desc\":\"The possible state reasons of a closed issue.\",\"fields\":{},\"kind\":\"ENUM\",\"name\":\"IssueClosedStateReason\",\"values\":[\"COMPLETED\",\"DUPLICATE\",\"NOT_PLANNED\"]},\"IssueEventConfidenceLevel\":{\"desc\":\"The confidence level associated with an agent's issue event action.\",\"fields\":{},\"kind\":\"ENUM\",\"name\":\"IssueEventConfidenceLevel\",\"values\":[\"HIGH\",\"LOW\",\"MEDIUM\"]},\"IssueState\":{\"desc\":\"The possible states of an issue.\",\"fields\":{},\"kind\":\"ENUM\",\"name\":\"IssueState\",\"values\":[\"CLOSED\",\"OPEN\"]},\"IssueStateUpdateInput\":{\"desc\":\"Specifies a target state for an issue, with optional metadata such as a\\nrationale, close reason, or duplicate reference. Suggestion metadata\\n(`rationale`, `confidence`, `suggest`) is only meaningful when `value` is\\n`CLOSED`; it is silently ignored otherwise.\",\"fields\":{\"confidence\":{\"args\":[],\"deprecated\":false,\"desc\":\"The confidence level the agent had when suggesting this close. Only meaningful when `value` is `CLOSED`.\",\"gqltype\":\"IssueEventConfidenceLevel\",\"list\":false,\"name\":\"confidence\",\"reqd\":false,\"type\":\"IssueEventConfidenceLevel\"},\"duplicateIssueId\":{\"args\":[],\"deprecated\":false,\"desc\":\"The ID of the issue that this is a duplicate of. Only meaningful when `value`\\nis `CLOSED` and `stateReason` is `DUPLICATE`.\",\"gqltype\":\"ID\",\"list\":false,\"name\":\"duplicateIssueId\",\"reqd\":false,\"type\":\"ID\"},\"rationale\":{\"args\":[],\"deprecated\":false,\"desc\":\"Optional rationale describing why the issue is being closed. Only meaningful when `value` is `CLOSED`. Max 280 characters.\",\"gqltype\":\"String\",\"list\":false,\"name\":\"rationale\",\"reqd\":false,\"t